Document Picture in Picture gets Dia's top bar.

Chrome's bar shows the origin and hides Back to Tab and close until the pointer is over the window, so a call's pop-out
showed no way back at rest. The bar is now 40 pt, #212123 with a 1 pt white hairline: Back to Tab is the video PiP's
28 pt corner button, always shown at the top left; the call tab's favicon and title sit in the middle and also go back
to the tab (hover highlight, pointing hand); close is the same corner button at the top right and still fades in on
hover. A page that asks for disallowReturnToOpener gets neither the button nor a clickable title. The views live in
chrome/browser/solara/pip/ac_document_pip_bar.cc.

